CAS expectations are caller observations; omission asserts absence.
Exit 4 means conflict, 5 rule refusal, and 6 damaged or unsupported store.

```console
$ tessera pin ls unmarked
? 6
error: repository unmarked has the layout no marker (possibly before #975; unmarked repositories are refused), and this build reads only `tessera-repository 2` (typed, namespaced refs, ADR-0067); there is no migration: create a new repository (`tessera init`) and import the source products again

$ tessera init repo
initialized tessera repository at repo

$ tessera pin ls kind-only
? 6
error: pin "kind": object kind mismatch: record Collection, object Product

$ tessera pin set kind-only kind @B@ --kind product --expected @B@
? 6
error: pin "kind": object kind mismatch: record Collection, object Product

$ tessera pin rm damaged missing --expected @ABSENT@
? 6
error: pin "missing": target @ABSENT@ is unreadable: [..]

$ tessera pin rm damaged torn --expected @D@
? 6
error: pin "torn": target @D@ is unreadable: [..]

$ tessera commit missing-block @BASE@ --set note=changed
? 5
error: commit: block 'data' (@BLOCK@) is neither supplied nor already in the store

$ tessera pin set repo absent @ABSENT@ --kind product
? 5
error: pin 'absent': @ABSENT@ is not stored in this repository

$ tessera collection commit repo main/collection.json
? 5
error: collection member closure failed at @B@ (version @M@ → @M@ → members[0] (@BASE@)): [..]

$ tessera import repo base.tsra
imported lineage @BASE@
  version @B@

$ tessera collection commit repo no-token/collection.json
? 5
error: [..]a forked_from collection requires a caller-supplied fork token in id_inputs; [..]

$ tessera collection commit repo main/collection.json
committed collection @MAIN@
  version @M@

$ tessera collection commit repo main/collection.json
? 4
error: ref '@MAIN@' moved: expected no tip, found @M@ (another commit landed first; nothing was written — rebuild on the current tip and commit again)

$ tessera collection commit repo wrong/collection.json --expected @B@
? 5
error: lineage '@BASE@' has kind Product; a write cannot change its kind

$ tessera pin set repo base @B@ --kind collection
? 5
error: pin "base": object kind mismatch: expected Collection, object Product

$ tessera pin set repo base @B@ --kind product
pinned "base" product @B@

$ tessera pin set repo base @B@ --kind product
? 4
error: pin "base" moved: expected no target, found @B@; no pin was changed — reread the pin before setting or removing it again

$ tessera pin rm repo base
? 4
error: pin "base" moved: expected no target, found @B@; no pin was changed — reread the pin before setting or removing it again

$ tessera pin rm repo base --expected @B@
removed pin "base"

$ tessera pin rm repo base
no pin "base"

```
